    "text": "Twelfhyndes mannes wer is twelf hund scyllinga.\nTwyhyndes mannes wer is twa hund scillinga.\nGif man ofsl\u00e6gen weor\u00f0e, gylde hine man swa he geboren sy.\n& riht is, \u00f0\u00e6t se slaga, si\u00f0\u00f0an he weres beweddod h\u00e6bbe, finde \u00f0\u00e6rto w\u00e6rborh, be \u00feam \u00f0e \u00f0\u00e6rto\n\u00d0onne \u00fe\u00e6t gedon sy, \u00f0onne r\u00e6re man cyninges munde, \u00f0\u00e6t is \u00f0\u00e6t hy ealle gem\u00e6num handum of \u00e6g\u00f0ere\nOf \u00f0am d\u00e6ge on XXI nihtan gylde man CXX scillinga to healsfange \u00e6t twelfhyndum were.\nHealsfang gebyre\u00f0 bearnum, bro\u00f0rum & f\u00e6deran; ne gebyre\u00f0 nanum m\u00e6ge \u00f0\u00e6t feo\u00f0 bute \u00f0am \u00f0e sy\nOf \u00f0am d\u00e6ge, \u00f0e \u00f0\u00e6t healsfang agolden sy, on XXI nihtan gylde man \u00f0a manbote; \u00f0\u00e6s on XXI nihtan\nSi\u00f0\u00f0an man mot mid lufe ofgan, gif man hwile fulle freondr\u00e6dne habban.\nEal man sceal \u00e6t cyrliscum were be \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6\u00f0e don, \u00f0e him to gebyre\u00f0, swa we be twelfhyndum",
